WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.900
Every result you’ve achieved tells a story.

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:05.720
So show it beautifully.

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:09.510
This is Medical Before After Gallery Pro.

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:13.890
Before and after galleries made for clinics,
right inside WordPress.

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:16.340
Start with the live map.

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:18.830
Point at the hair.

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:20.330
The lips.

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:21.650
The skin.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:25.220
And the right results appear beside it, instantly.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:30.630
Or browse a simple list of treatments,
and see a result for each.

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:35.040
Visitors can find someone like themselves.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:37.790
Same age. Same concern.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.160
The closest result comes first.

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:43.990
Show your cases in a refined grid.

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:50.310
Turn the whole wall from before to after,
with one switch.

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:54.460
Or point at a face, and it opens up.

00:00:56.710 --> 00:00:58.910
Choose how each card compares.

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:02.340
Drag. Hover. Switch.

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:03.940
Or side by side.

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:07.030
Choose how visitors navigate.

00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:13.970
Photo pills. Icons. Tabs.

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:16.000
Or a search box.

00:01:17.450 --> 00:01:19.370
And choose how a case opens.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:20.810
Full screen.

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:23.780
On a comparison desk.

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:26.050
Or as a story.

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:29.180
Mark what changed.

00:01:30.630 --> 00:01:32.810
Follow a patient, month by month.

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:36.750
Give it your own look.

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:39.930
Watermark every photo.

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:44.940
And keep sensitive ones covered,
until someone chooses to look.

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:48.800
Start free. Go Pro when you’re ready.

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.370
Medical Before After Gallery.
